12,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Servas. Let’s keep our unity strong. Takumi, please stay safe tonight.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Toshio,,I remain silent. Words are cheap. Let the night speak for itself.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
